  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nIt is not clear what the origin of a document created with [`DOMParser.parseFromString()`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dynamic-markup-insertion.html#dom-domparser-parsefromstring) should be. \n\nWould adding a step or appending step 2 to set  _document_'s origin to \"this's relevant global object's associated Document's origin\" make sense here?",
